## Active Skills & Agents
- `subagent-council`: Review prompt before coding and review project before closing.
- `subagent-helper`: Offload isolated search, test generation, and refactoring.
- `subagent-driven-development`: Dispatch task-by-task execution.
- `verification-before-completion`: Gated command check (exit code 0 required).